PART 2 — STARTING THE ALGORITHMS


We’re not building one algorithm.

We’re building
a constrained multi-agent system.


Below is a minimal viable architecture.




Core Design Rules


Modular (no god-AI)
Deterministic where possible
Probabilistic where necessary
Auditable
Replaceable
Power-decaying




High-Level Architecture


┌─────────────────────┐
│  Axiom Engine       │  ← immutable constraints
└─────────┬───────────┘
          │
┌─────────▼───────────┐
